SUMMARY:EPW 2026: Deep Dive 2: Robust power system planning – linking gri
 d infrastructure and flexibility
LOCATION:Auditorium\, GIZ Campus Forum\, Friedrich-Ebert-Allee 32\, 53113 B
 onn\, Germany
DESCRIPTION:As solar and wind shares grow and electrification reshapes dema
 nd\, power systems need more grid capacity and more flexibility\, and the 
 two are closely linked. This session shares experiences in connecting nati
 onal energy scenarios with grid and flexibility planning: where grid expan
 sion is needed\, where flexibility offers a cost-effective complement\, an
 d how to avoid unnecessary investment while maintaining reliability.\n\nPr
 ovisional programme\, check for changes: https://energyplanningweek.info/#
 deep-dive-2
